                                "sense_id": "bc1215b3-9d28-36e4-b8d0-b4af57e68a36",
                                "text": "A very hard, vitreouslike substance, composed of hexagonal prisms, with a common direction at right angles to the dentoenamel junction or line marking the union of the enamel and dentin."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "751bc9b9-fcd1-4871-849f-dbce90b12ff5",
                                "sense_id": "bc1215b3-9d28-36e4-b8d0-b4af57e68a36",
                                "text": "However, if the hydroxide was allowed to dry at room temperature, it was reduced to approximately one-third of its original solid volume, forming a very hard, vitreouslike material."
                            }
